@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### Obtener todos los platos
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Obtener un plato por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/6640f0b0e4b0e0e0e0e0e0e0

### Crear un plato
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ensalada Cesar",
  "description": "Lechuga fresca con pollo y parmesano.",
  "ingredients": ["lechuga", "pollo", "parmesano", "croutons", "salsa ranch"],
  "price": 8.99,
  "celiacFriendly": false,
  "vegan": false,
  "diabeticFriendly": false,
  "calories": 350,
  "image": "https://via.placeholder.com/400x300?text=Ensalada+Cesar"
}

### Actualizar un plato
PUT {{baseUrl}}/6640f0b0e4b0e0e0e0e0e0e0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9.99
}

### Eliminar un plato
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6640f0b0e4b0e0e0e0e0e0e0
